WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:09.660
In this video I want to show how you, as a farmer, can help us make the model smarter by sending us your detections.

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:18.180
All detections are stored locally, and we can export them to send them to us.

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:22.380
You do that by going to the Recordings tab. I have it in English here.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.100
At the top right it says Export.

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:35.480
Click it. This window opens, where you can enter a from date and a to date.

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:43.220
If you leave them empty, it includes all data. For me that is 1,700 detections, or recordings.

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:49.420
What we need: please tick this box to send only the original photos.

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:54.100
It says so here too. It is a much smaller file, and we can't use the rest anyway.

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:55.620
We can't use the videos.

00:00:56.960 --> 00:01:03.980
By ticking this we have enough: we have the data to make the model smarter.

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:07.920
In this case I take one day as an example.

00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:12.220
Then it says I have selected 195 detections.

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:14.520
Then I click Download ZIP.

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:21.480
And at the top right you see the AI Detector recordings file.

00:01:22.620 --> 00:01:23.980
And what we can do then is...

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:28.260
We go to Telegram. That is by far the easiest way to send it.

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:32.340
You can also simply open it as a web app on your computer.

00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:37.460
Then you join the CowCatcher AI open source project group.

00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:43.780
I will then automatically send you a message: I see you joined the group, are you running CowCatcher or do you need help?

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:46.700
You can reply to that, of course. That's me.

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:51.700
Or you send a personal message straight to Jacob5456, which is also me.

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:54.000
Once you have done that, you have...

00:01:54.000 --> 00:02:06.400
...a personal chat with me, and from there you can easily send the ZIP folder in the same menu. Click Send, it is sent to us and we take it from there.

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:11.680
Once you have sent your detections, you can also remove them.

00:02:11.780 --> 00:02:13.940
So, we are back in the AI Detector.

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:23.540
We go to Settings, under Storage, and here at Remove old recordings you enter a date.

00:02:23.540 --> 00:02:30.360
The last date, then Review, and it asks whether you want to remove them.

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:32.760
And this cannot be undone.

00:02:34.640 --> 00:02:38.320
And then they are removed and your disk is empty again.

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:42.400
Storage is only needed to show them here.

00:02:42.900 --> 00:02:46.960
If you don't use that, you can safely remove them all up to this day.
